01:40:13.405 --> 01:40:14.365
Uh-huh.


01:40:14.405 --> 01:40:16.845
Man, woman,
meaning one man-woman.


01:40:18.165 --> 01:40:19.845
That's interesting.


01:40:20.525 --> 01:40:24.325
That's very good. It's more masculine.


01:40:25.605 --> 01:40:28.885
