01:43:17.525 --> 01:43:22.205
Your breath gets a little like
hyperventilating a bit.


01:43:22.245 --> 01:43:26.645
I stop halfway up and think I'm
gonna have to get my composure.


01:43:26.685 --> 01:43:29.045
